m),E1,family="binomial")

 

I hope the above is the right way of doing it in the new glmer. 

 

This looks good to me!





The model output suggests that there were strong correlations among the
random slopes; and also, the variance for cAccent and the interaction item
slope seemed to be very small.

 

Random effects:

